    "enUS": {
      "description": "Ah, it's a big day fer ya I see; here for yer first ram are ye?\r\n\r\nThese rams are the most steadfast and sturdy in all of Azeroth. They're fiercely protective of their rider. Aye, you'll have a hard time finding a more stalwart companion for yer journeys.\r\n\r\nSo, you have an important choice to make. You and yer ram will traverse the world together so choose wisely! Not to worry lad, whatever choice you make will be the right one.\r\n\r\nGo see the rams and return to me when you've made yer choice.",
      "objectiveLines": [
